# Who may sign a change to what installs BOb on a box (O-3, P5 §6.2;
# scripts/firma-instalacion.sh verificar). ONE PUBLIC KEY per line, never a
# private one:
#   henry namespaces="bob-install-chain",verify-required sk-ssh-ed25519@openssh.com AAAA...
#   henry namespaces="bob-install-chain",presence-only sk-ecdsa-sha2-nistp256@openssh.com AAAA...
# The principal is one plain name. The options are namespaces="bob-install-chain"
# (required) and exactly one of:
#   verify-required  the signature must be touched (UP, 0x01) and verify its
#                    user with a PIN or biometric (UV, 0x04): a FIDO2 key with
#                    a PIN.
#   presence-only    the signature must be touched (UP, 0x01); UV is not
#                    required, and the line says so in the open. For a key
#                    that cannot report UV: the Secure Enclave with Touch ID,
#                    whose provider refuses verify-required and signs with UV
#                    off. docs/adr/0001-firma-instalacion-solo-presencia.md.
# Neither, both, or one twice is refused. Only a security key (sk-) is
# accepted; cert-authority, no-touch-required and any other option are
# refused. UV follows the line of the key that signed.
# This is BOb's format, not ssh-keygen's: ssh-keygen refuses verify-required
# in an allowed_signers file ("bad options: unknown key option", OpenSSH 10.3
# and 10.6p2) and knows no presence-only. verificar checks every line, gives
# ssh-keygen a copy of its own without either, and itself reads the flags from
# the signature. Do not hand this file to ssh-keygen directly.
# CI reads this file from main, never from the PR. A box reads its own copy,
# /opt/bob/firmantes_instalacion (root's, 644), never the checkout's. The key is
# this file's alone, not the one in firmantes_imagen.
# Henry's Secure Enclave key (Touch ID), presence-only: docs/adr/0001.
# ssh-keygen -lf: SHA256:52FmFU3f+b8DSe7osQv3FLUJnhHO5Orf+OdXKSfqClU
henry namespaces="bob-install-chain",presence-only sk-ecdsa-sha2-nistp256@openssh.com AAAAInNrLWVjZHNhLXNoYTItbmlzdHAyNTZAb3BlbnNzaC5jb20AAAAIbmlzdHAyNTYAAABBBLSxT95lcVyLhEW1WvXPdiomP9X36HsvZdtP/s6fF+2ZTDuTDRjSKDcTCgf8KqykKV+AgPipsPebvmitDLjGENwAAAAEc3NoOg==
